<b>Commands</b>

/start — start
/ingredients — my ingredients
/cocktails — what to make
/settings — settings
/deleteme — download or delete my data
/help — this help

<b>How it works</b>
1. In /ingredients mark what you have. Only spirits, liqueurs, vermouths, wine, bitters and syrups are needed: they are hard to buy on the go. Juices, citrus and ice do not need to be marked.
2. In /cocktails the bot shows what you can make, cocktails missing one or two ingredients, and what to buy to unlock more.
3. In a cocktail card ✅ means you have the ingredient, ❌ means it is missing, • means it can be bought in a shop.

Non-alcoholic cocktails and favorites are in /cocktails too. On a cocktail card you can add it to favorites and mark that you have already made it.

The bot works in private chats only.
